---
title: Order Checkout Sequence
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor user as Customer
    participant fe as Web App
    participant api as API Gateway
    participant pay as Payment Svc
    participant db as Postgres
    user->>fe: Submit Order
    fe->>api: POST /checkout
    api->>pay: Authorize Card
    pay->>db: Store Ledger TX
    db-->>pay: TX Committed
    pay-->>api: Payment Succeeded
    api-->>fe: 201 Created (Order #491)
    fe-->>user: Show Confirmation
